<http://data.silknow.org/object/8dee455a-07a1-38b9-8334-ec7d2258131b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Part of a cover, silk satin embroidered with silk in atma and counched threads and with metal thread in padded couching.\nThe ground is red and there is  fine couched line using metal thread which forms a border down the two sides.  There are three complete bands of pattern and partial bands top and bottom.  Each band contains three diagonal blossoms alternating in colour: predominantly blue or white."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8dee455a-07a1-38b9-8334-ec7d2258131b> .

